**Patient:** Okay, that sounds good. What else can I do to help lower my cholesterol?

**Doctor:** In addition to the diet changes, I'd like you to start getting regular exercise, like your bike rides. And we'll be monitoring your cholesterol levels regularly to make sure they're coming down. We'll also be checking your blood pressure and doing some other tests to make sure everything is within normal ranges.

**Patient:** Alright, got it. And how often will I need to come back?

**Doctor:** We'll schedule a follow-up appointment in 3 to 6 months to check in on your progress and make any necessary adjustments to your treatment plan.

