[patient] protonix 40 milligrams once a day, and i've been doing well with that.
[doctor] okay. and any other symptoms? any nausea or vomiting?
[patient] no, nothing like that.
[doctor] okay. all right. well, let's go ahead and do a quick physical exam. hey, dax, show me the vital signs. hey, dax. ms. phillips, your vital signs look good. your blood pressure is 140 over 80. your heart rate is a little bit fast, but that's to be expected with your atrial fibrillation. your lungs are clear to auscultation bilaterally. your abdomen is nice and soft, no edema in your lower extremities. i do appreciate that your thyroid is a little bit enlarged, but it's not tender. and there are no carotid bruits. on your heart exam, you do have an irregular rate and rhythm, but that's consistent with your atrial fibrillation. and on your musculoskeletal exam, your joints are nice and stable, no arthralgias or myalgias.
