[patient] yes, i am. i take it twice a day.
[doctor] okay. okay. and do you have any other symptoms like cough or shortness of breath?
[patient] no, no shortness of breath.
[doctor] okay. okay. all right. and, um, do you smoke or drink?
[patient] i do drink.
