dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi, jason, good to see you today. how are you?
[patient] i'm doing okay, doctor. how about you?
[doctor] i'm doing well, thank you. so, i see here that you're here for a hypercholesterolemia evaluation. tell me a little bit about that. how's that going?
[patient] well, i've been having a lot of headaches, and my mom said it's because of my cholesterol, so i thought i'd come in and get it checked.
[doctor] okay. and have you noticed any other symptoms? like, have you had any chest pain or shortness of breath?
[patient] no, i haven't had any of that.
[doctor] okay. and any other symptoms like dizziness or palpitations?
[patient] no, nothing like that.
[doctor] okay. and do you have a family history of heart disease or hypercholesterolemia?
[patient] well, my cousin had a heart attack in his 40's, but i don't know if that's because of the cholesterol.
[doctor] okay. and do you have any family history of diabetes or hypertension?
[patient] no, none that i know of.
[doctor] okay. and do you smoke?
[patient] no, i don't smoke.
[doctor] okay. do you drink?
[patient] i don't drink.
[doctor] okay. and do you exercise?
[patient] yeah, i love to ride my bike on trails.
