[patient] i'm feeling a little bit swollen in my elbow joints and i have some body aches. and i have a rash.
[doctor] okay. so i see here that you have type two diabetes and hypertension. how are those going?
[patient] they're okay. i've been feeling a little bit tired and lacking a lot of energy. i've been having some nausea. i haven't been able to eat a lot.
