dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi anna how are you
[patient] i'm doing okay
[doctor] okay so i know you're here for your joint pain so can you tell me a little bit about what's going on with your elbow
[patient] yeah so my left elbow has been bothering me a lot
[doctor] okay and can you tell me a little bit more about that
[patient] so i sit at my desk all day for work with my elbows bent and after work it's really hard for me to flex and extend my left elbow it's really stiff and painful and i've noticed some swelling on the olecranon of my elbow
[doctor] okay and are you right or left handed
[patient] i'm right handed
[doctor] okay and can you still write with your left hand
[patient] yeah i can still write which is great but typing is really difficult
[doctor] okay and any numbness or tingling in your hands
[patient] no
[doctor] okay and any weakness in your arm
[patient] a little bit but nothing too significant
[doctor] okay and any fever or chills
[patient] no
[doctor] okay so let's talk a little bit about your past medical history so i know you have epilepsy can you tell me a little bit about that
[patient] yeah i have epilepsy and my last seizure was a year ago and i've been doing really well on my medication
[doctor] okay and what medication are you on
[patient] i'm on keppra
[doctor] okay and have you had any recent seizures
[patient] no
[doctor] okay and what about depression can you tell me a little bit about that
[patient] yeah i started therapy last year and i'm trying to avoid medications for it but i'm still trying to figure out what works for me
[doctor] okay and how's therapy going
[patient] it's been helpful but i'm still feeling down and stressed
[doctor] okay and have you had any suicidal or homicidal ideations
[patient] no
[doctor] okay and what about your peptic ulcer disease can you tell me a little bit about that
[patient] yeah i had a lot of stress last year and then i had an endoscopy and they found that i had an episode of gastritis and they diagnosed me with peptic ulcer disease and put me on protonix
[doctor] okay and how are you doing with that
[patient] it's been good i haven't had any issues since the procedure
