dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi, emily. how are you?
[patient] hi, doctor. i'm doing well.
[doctor] good. so i see that you're here for your annual follow-up. i know you're trying to join the military and i know they have some fitness requirements that you need to meet. and you're trying to get off of your inhalers. so let's talk a little bit about your asthma. how are you doing?
[patient] i've been doing well. i've been trying to reduce my inhalers.
