[doctor] yeah. i think you have resistant hypertension. i've added spironolactone to your regimen. i'm going to see you in two weeks to check your blood pressure and do a basic metabolic panel. i'm also going to start you on carvedilol. i'm going to have you reduce your salt intake to 1500 to <2000 milligrams per day. i'm also going to have you follow the dash diet. i'm going to have you meet with a nutritionist to help you with your diet. and i'm going to have you monitor your potassium and sodium levels.
