dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi, brittany. how are you?
[patient] hi. i'm doing okay. i'm just having some issues with my stomach.
[doctor] okay. i see that you're back in the clinic today for your irritable bowel syndrome. can you tell me a little bit about what's going on? how are you feeling?
[patient] i'm still having my flare ups. i've been having some cramps and sharp pains. i ate some shrimp the other day and it made my stomach hurt and i felt bloated.
[doctor] okay. that sounds like it could be a bit of a problem. have you been taking your bentyl?
[patient] i have been. i've been taking it as needed.
[doctor] okay. and have you noticed any episodes of diarrhea after eating chicken alfredo?
[patient] yes, i do. i don't think it's related to the alfredo, though.
[doctor] okay. and do you drink any alcohol?
[patient] yes, i do. i have 2 drinks when i'm out.
[doctor] okay. and have you noticed any changes in your bowel movements?
[patient] i've been having 2-3 formed stools a day.
[doctor] okay. and are you having any nausea?
[patient] yes, i am.
[doctor] okay. let's take a look at your vitals. your heart rate and rhythm are good. your lungs are clear. your abdomen is soft and non-tender. your bowel sounds are normoactive. so, let's talk a little bit about your diet. have you been eating any greasy or fatty foods?
[patient] yes, i have been eating fried chicken today.
[doctor] okay. and have you been drinking any soda?
[patient] no, i've been trying to avoid that.
[doctor] okay. that's good. and how about your sleeping habits? are you getting enough sleep?
[patient] i'm trying to get 7 hours a night.
[doctor] okay. that's good. and have you been under a lot of stress?
[patient] yes, i have been.
[doctor] okay. well, let's talk a little bit about your treatment plan. i want to start you on a low dose of elavil at bedtime to help with your stress and your bowel movements. i also want you to continue taking your bentyl as needed. and if you need something for nausea, you can take zofran. i want you to reduce your consumption of greasy foods and alcohol. i also want you to try to get more fiber in your diet.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and i want to see you back in the clinic in a month. if you have any issues or need any adjustments to your medication, please don't hesitate to reach out to me.
[patient] okay. thank you, doctor.
[doctor] you're welcome. take care. }}<|eot_id|>
