[patient] no, i did not pass out.
[doctor] okay, let's take a look at your neck. i'm just going to press on your neck here. does that hurt?
[patient] no, it does not.
[doctor] okay, let's look at your head. i'm just going to press on your head here. does that hurt?
[patient] no, it does not.
[doctor] okay, let's look at your shoulder. i'm just going to press on your shoulder here. does that hurt?
