dialogue is: {{ [doctor] hi dennis good to see you today
[patient] hi how are you
[doctor] i'm doing well dennis is a 46-year-old male here for right heel pain dennis how are you doing today
[patient] i'm doing okay i'm doing okay
[doctor] all right so you're here for right heel pain how long has that been going on for
[patient] about ten days now
[doctor] okay and what makes your pain get worse
[patient] well when i'm working out and then when i get up in the morning
[doctor] okay and then it's better after you sit for a long period of time
[patient] yeah it comes back when i stand
[doctor] okay and are you doing any sports or activities that are causing this
[patient] i'm training for a triathlon
[doctor] okay and what's the training consist of
[patient] i run ten kilometers in the morning at lunchtime i try to get on the bike for about 45 minutes to an hour and then i go to the aquatic center and swim for thirty minutes to an hour
[doctor] okay and how often do you do that
[patient] i run five days a week i alternate between a long run and a long bike ride on the weekends and then i take one day off
[doctor] okay and do you stretch at all
[patient] no i don't
[doctor] okay and any pain in your left leg
[patient] no
[doctor] okay let's do a quick physical exam of your right heel on exam of your right heel pain with extension there is pain pain with flexion there is mild pain positive calcaneal squeeze test severe tenderness to the achilles tendon thompson test is negative bilaterally so dennis what i'm going to do is i'm going to recommend that we treat you conservatively for this i want you to take at least a week off from your training to recover from this i'm going to give you a referral for formal physical therapy to strengthen your right lower extremities and i'm going to give you three tablets of ibuprofen every six hours for the pain if your pain does not improve with physical therapy we can obtain an x-ray but i'm going to have you follow up with me in seven to ten days to check on your progress and then we can go from there okay
[patient] okay
[doctor] any questions
[patient] nope
[doctor] all right well i'll see you in seven to ten days dennis
[patient] okay thanks }}<|eot_id|>
