[patient] no, no abdominal pain or diarrhea.
[doctor] okay. alright. well, let's go ahead and do a physical exam. i'm gon na start with your abdomen. does it hurt when i press here?
[patient] no, it doesn't hurt.
[doctor] okay. it's a little warm to touch. your abdomen is warm to touch, but it's not tender to palpation. your belly looks nice and flat. let's look at your skin. i see you have a little bullseye rash on your left abdominal quadrant. is that where you had the bug bite?
[patient] yes, that's where i had the bug bite.
