[patient] okay.
[doctor] i want to see you again next week for a follow-up for this.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and for your hypertension, it sounds like it's been well-controlled based on your home monitoring, and you've been compliant with dietary modifications, including limiting your sodium intake. i'm just gon na order a lipid panel.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and you will continue your lisinopril 10 milligrams a day. i refilled that for you today.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] for your diabetes, you have noticed intermittent elevations of your blood glucose levels, but you have been compliant with the use of metformin. your diet has been limited due to nausea in the setting of lyme disease. i'm just gon na order a hemoglobin a1c to make sure that we don't need to make any medication changes.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] does that sound good to you?
[patient] yes, that sounds good.
[doctor] okay. i'll see you next week.
[patient] thank you. }}<|eot_id|>
