[doctor] so, carolyn, i'm gon na go ahead and order an x-ray of your right elbow. i'm gon na go ahead and prescribe meloxicam 15 milligrams once a day for the pain and swelling. i'm also gon na continue you on the colchicine 0.6 milligrams twice a day as needed for flare ups of your gout. and we will continue the steroid cream for your psoriasis.
