[patient] no, i haven't.
[doctor] okay. and then, how's your bowel movements been since you started the citrucel and the probiotics?
[patient] it's been better. i'm still having some issues, but it's been better.
[doctor] okay. and then, how's the bentyl been working for your cramps?
[patient] it's been okay. i still have some issues.
[doctor] okay. and then, how's the zofran been working for your nausea?
[patient] it's been okay. i don't really have nausea too much anymore.
[doctor] okay. so, let's talk a little bit about your diet. so, what kind of foods do you eat?
[patient] i eat a lot of vegetables. i try to eat healthy.
