[doctor] okay. well, i'm going to go ahead and take a look at your exam. i'm gon na listen to your heart and lungs and check your abdomen. so, your heart and lungs sound good. i don't hear any abnormal sounds. your abdomen is a little bit warm to the touch, but it's not tender. i'm gon na go ahead and take a look at your rash. okay, so i'm gon na examine your rash. i don't see anything that looks like a rash on your left arm. i do see a small bullseye rash on your left abdominal quadrant.
