[patient] yeah, i think they are.
[doctor] okay. so, have you tried any stress-reducing techniques like yoga or meditation?
[patient] no, i haven't.
[doctor] okay. well, let's talk a little bit about your medical history. have you had any other symptoms like this before?
[patient] no, this is the first time i've had this.
