[patient] okay.
[doctor] so, for your rheumatoid arthritis, i'm gon na continue you on the xeljanz, 11 milligrams, once a day, and the celebrex, 200 milligrams, once a day. i'm gon na also have my nurse come in and give you some instructions on how to elevate your leg and how to wear compression stockings. i'm gon na also recommend that you follow up with your primary care physician for further instructions on how to manage your edema.
