[patient] i work at the bakery.
[doctor] okay. all right. so i'm going to go ahead and do a physical exam. i'm going to check your vitals. your blood pressure is 120 over 80. your heart rate is 72. your respiratory rate is 16. your oxygen saturation is 99 percent on room air.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and i'm going to check your abdomen. i'm not feeling any masses or tenderness. i'm going to check your back. you do have some pain to palpation of the midline of your lower back, especially on the left. you do not have any pain to palpation of the upper back. you do have some pain to palpation on the right lower back. and on your neurological exam, you do have a mildly positive straight leg raise on the right and positive straight leg raise on the left.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] all right. i'm going to go ahead and order some tests. i'm going to order an x-ray of your low back. i'm also going to order a hemoglobin a1c, since you haven't had one in a while. and i'm also going to refer you to physical therapy to help with the pain. i'm going to prescribe you some ibuprofen, 400 milligrams up to three times a day. you can also take tylenol if the pain is severe. and i'm also going to prescribe you some flexeril.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] any questions?
[patient] no.
[doctor] all right. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you some medication. i'm also going to give you a referral to physical therapy. and i want you to be careful with the medications, especially if you're doing any strenuous activities like driving. i don't want you to overuse the muscle relaxers.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and i want you to check your blood sugar in the morning and log that information for me.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] and continue with your current diet and exercise.
[patient] okay.
[doctor] all right. i'm going to go ahead and order the hemoglobin a1c and the x-ray. and i'm going to give you a prescription for the ibuprofen and the flexeril. i'm also going to give you a referral to physical therapy. do you have any questions?
[patient] no.
[doctor] all right. do you have any other questions for me?
[patient] no.
[doctor] all right. well, i'll see you in a few weeks. take care of yourself.
[patient] thank you.
[doctor] you're welcome.
[patient] bye.
[doctor] bye. }}<|eot_id|>
