[patient] i was taking out the trash and i slipped on some black ice and fell and hurt my ankle.
[doctor] okay, and then what happened? how did you end up?
[patient] my friend had to help me up. i was unable to walk.
[doctor] okay, and then what did you do after that?
[patient] i put ice on it and elevated it throughout the night.
[doctor] okay, and has that helped?
[patient] it's a little better.
[doctor] okay, and how about pain? have you had any pain?
[patient] yeah, i've had some pain.
